*Start of 03_Act2Scene2*
@back Road tint:#6666AA
@spawn SunShafts
During your journey, you've been looking outside of the truck, watching environments change before your eyes.
You have traveled through scorching deserts, ruined cities of human civilization, and arid wastelands, previously lush grasslands now ruined by pollution caused by the previous inhabitants of this planet.
At last, you spot a large mountain range, your target destination, far in the distance.
John drives the truck closer to the expected coordinates of the ancient lab, which is supposed to be inside the mountain somewhere.
The truck slows down and stops. John steps out of the car and speaks up.

@char JohnMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
JohnMaxwell: We are finally here.

@char JohnMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultLeft
@char KatieMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
@char JaneHolifield.Default pose:DefaultRight
JohnMaxwell: Katie, take the tools. Jane, gather your equipment. Contractor, help carry the food and medicine.
Katie and Jane both nod in agreement and get to work.

@hide KatieMaxwell
@hide JaneHolifield
@char TarosJones.Default pose:DefaultRight
JohnMaxwell: Taros, you're in charge until I make sure the perimeter is secured.
TarosJones: Got it boss.
Taros responds with a quick nod, while John heads out to check the surroundings.
@hideChars

@char TarosJones.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
@char JaneHolifield.Default pose:DefaultRight
@char KatieMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultLeft
You look at the people around you. The mood is still tense, but at least there are no Earthflame problems so far. It seems like this operation might go well.
@hideChars

@char TarosJones.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
TarosJones: Arright people, let's get to work.
Taros leads the way to the cave entrance. You follow him inside.
@hideChars

@back Black
The cave is dark and empty at first, but as you walk further, you enter a room with strange lighting and symbols on the walls.
@back Lab tint:#6666AA
@despawn SunShafts
TheContractor: Woah. Is this the lab? I've never seen anything like this before.
@char JaneHolifield.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
Jane suddenly appears out of nowhere.
JaneHolifield: Finally, someone who understands beauty.
JaneHolifield: Think about how everything here was built right under human civilization.
JaneHolifield: Think about how they lived, what they ate, and what their culture was.
Up until now, Jane has been silent, it is slightly surprising to hear Jane being so energetic and vocal about her thoughts.
Jane's energy suddenly shifts to a calm demeanor.
While holding her hand in front of her mouth. She says to you.
JaneHolifield: *cough* Anyway, I must start my research.
Jane walks away silently, leaving you wondering about her sudden change in behavior.
@hideChars

@char KatieMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
KatieMaxwell: She has always been excited about this ancient civilization.
KatieMaxwell: I remember her showing me her collection for hours when I was little.
Katie smiles and shakes her head, lost in memories.
@char KatieMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultLeft
@char TarosJones.Default pose:DefaultRight
TarosJones: Heh, our Janie has always been obsessed with this crap.
Taros picks some kind of phone-looking device.
TarosJones: Anyways, why don't you two go look over the west side of the lab? I'll be right over here.
Taros points to the west, where you can see some screens and more symbols on the walls.
@hideChars

You and Katie move to the west side of the lab, examining the screens and symbols.
After a quick inspection, it seems like the symbols represent some sort of buttons or controls for something.
@char KatieMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
KatieMaxwell: Oh yeah, I haven't been able to ask you how you're doing.
KatieMaxwell: I know all of this must be quite overwhelming.
TheContractor: *sigh* It is a lot, but I think I am managing.
TheContractor: Mainly trying to figure out my past and what happened to me.
@hideChars

Why where you so attached to the artifact? What was it about the relic that made you feel so connected to it?
Why can't you remember anything about your past? What happened to you?
Pushing those thoughts aside for a moment, you look around the lab, remembering the time in the camp when you felt strangely attached to the artifact.
@char KatieMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
You are about to talk to Katie about it when John rushes into the room.
@char KatieMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultLeft
@char JohnMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultRight
JohnMaxwell: It's a trap! Ulysses just noticed a weird signal coming from here!
As John finishes speaking, the cave starts to tremble, and you hear explosions.
@char JohnMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
@char TarosJones.Default pose:DefaultRight
TarosJones: Everyone, evacuate the lab now!
@hideChars

Just as you begin to run towards the entrance, a big rock falls in middle of the doorway, sealing the way out.
@back Lab tint:#333344
@char KatieMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
KatieMaxwell: Goddamnit! What do we do now?!
@char KatieMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultLeft
@char JohnMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultRight
JohnMaxwell: Calm down! We still have people outside.
@char JohnMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
@char TarosJones.Default pose:DefaultRight
TarosJones: We have to keep moving. Let's go deeper into the lab.
TarosJones: If we stay here, we die.
@hideChars

Everyone starts running deeper into the lab, until even the ground itself starts to tremble.
And then, the ground gives way.
You realize that the floor under you is crumbling and you all start falling down into the darkness below you.
@char JaneHolifield.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
JaneHolifield: Oh well, at least I'll die with the ancients.
@char JaneHolifield.Default pose:DefaultLeft
@char KatieMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultRight
KatieMaxwell: Now is not the time for jokes!
@hideChars

@back Black
Everyone starts falling and screaming, as you all fall into the darkness.
You notice light below you, in the darkness, and you brace yourself for immediate demise.
TheContractor: I'm going to die...!
You close your eyes, accepting your fate.
However the end doesn't come.
Instead of hitting the ground, you feel a strange force lifting you up.
@char JaneHolifield.Default pose:DefaultLeft
@char KatieMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
@char TarosJones.Default pose:DefaultRight
You open your eyes and see the rest of the team floating in the air, about twenty centimeters off the ground, just like you.
@hideChars

@char JohnMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
JohnMaxwell: What the hell... We were... but... that's impossible.
JohnMaxwell: Coming to a sudden stop like this... Inertia itself should have killed us. What the hell is going here?
@hide JohnMaxwell

@char KatieMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
KatieMaxwell: Is... Is everyone alright?
You notice Katie is still shaken from the fall, but manages to keep her composure.
@char KatieMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultLeft
@char JohnMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultRight
JohnMaxwell: I... I think so.
@char JohnMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
@char TarosJones.Default pose:DefaultRight
TarosJones: I'm fine!
You notice that everyone seems safe and sound, except for Jane who has not spoken yet.
@hideChars

@char JaneHolifield.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
You search for Jane, and see her floating still, looking around herself, her head swiveling around.
TheContractor: Jane, is everything alrigh-
JaneHolifield: MAGNIFICENT!
JaneHolifield: This is... This is... I can't believe it!
JaneHolifield: We are breaking the laws of physics right now! There must be some kind of inertia dampening field around us!
JaneHolifield: This is ancient technology for sure! This is... This is...!
Jane seems lost in her own world, as she looks around in awe.
@hideChars

You turn towards everyone else, and see that they are equally amazed and confused.
@char TarosJones.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
TarosJones: That's Janie alright.
@char TarosJones.Default pose:DefaultLeft
@char KatieMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultRight
KatieMaxwell: She's always been like this when it comes to ancient technology.
Katie raises her hand over her forehead.
KatieMaxwell: *sigh* Now I feel stupid for getting scared over this.
@char TarosJones.Default pose:DefaultLeft
@char KatieMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
@char JohnMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultRight
JohnMaxwell: Focus! Danger is not over yet!
JohnMaxwell: We need to find a way out of here.
John's voice snaps everyone back into reality.
You've just avoided a close encounter with death, but you're still not out of the woods yet. You need to get out of this place and find out where you are.
KatieMaxwell: Right, let's try to figure out how to get out of this... Inertia dampening field?
KatieMaxwell: Jane, any thoughts?
@hideChars

@char JaneHolifield.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
You look at Jane, and she seems to have finally come back from whatever trance she was in.
JaneHolifield: I'm still trying to figure out how this works. But I think we need to find the source of this field.
JaneHolifield: There should be a transmitter or a generator somewhere around here, which is supplying power to this field and keeping us afloat.
@hideChars

Suddenly you get the same feel as with the relic before, but much stronger.
@spawn Blur
@wait 0.8
You suddenly feel like saying words, which do not make sense, or which you can't understand.
You say, in a monotone voice.
TheContractor: <i>Deactivate the levitation field.</i>

@char JohnMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultLeft
@char KatieMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
@char TarosJones.Default pose:DefaultRight
Everyone looks at you in confusion.
@hideChars
Everyone suddenly falls onto the floor. The field that was holding all of you in place, has vanished.

@char JohnMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
John looks at you, with a mix of confusion and awe.
JohnMaxwell: What the hell just happened?
TheContractor: I... I don't know. I just felt like I had to say that.
You notice the feeling has left you, and you feel normal again.
@hideChars

Suddenly, you feel it again. It feels like you need to go somewhere.
You look and point to the east, without knowing why.
You speak in monotone voice again.
TheContractor: <i>We should go there...</i>
You start walking towards the east.

@char JohnMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
JohnMaxwell: What is going on? Why is he acting like this?
@char JohnMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultLeft
@char KatieMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultRight
KatieMaxwell: I don't know, but it's not like we have any other options. We either wait to be rescued or follow him.
@char KatieMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
@char TarosJones.Default pose:DefaultRight
TarosJones: I agree. Let's follow him. We'll hopefully figure out a way out of here, or at least find some answers.
@hide JohnMaxwell
@char KatieMaxwell.Default pose:DefaultLeft
@char TarosJones.Default pose:DefaultMiddle
@char JaneHolifield.Default pose:DefaultRight
JaneHolifield: He might be onto something. Let's go!
@hideChars

You don't know what awaits you in the east, but you feel like it has something to do with your lost memory.
*End of 03_Act2Scene2*
@goto Scene5
@stop
